WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.566 --> 00:00:17.708
and Mandy followed Gildong to the nobleman's house.

2
00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:21.089
He led them through a busy street.

3
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:25.730
Suddenly Mandy noticed something strange.

4
00:00:26.891 --> 00:00:29.872
"Why are so many people wearing white?"

5
00:00:30.372 --> 00:00:30.992
she asked.

6
00:00:32.128 --> 00:00:33.328
Gildong laughed.

7
00:00:34.549 --> 00:00:37.950
"You must be from very far away," he said.

8
00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.911
"In Korea poor people usually wear white.

9
00:00:42.911 --> 00:00:45.372
Only nobles and royalty can wear colors."

10
00:00:45.392 --> 00:00:48.333
"So that's where we are!"

11
00:00:48.753 --> 00:00:49.613
thought Mandy.

12
00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:56.055
"Korea!" Soon the children reached a large house.

13
00:00:57.155 --> 00:00:59.976
In the courtyard people looked very busy.

14
00:01:00.984 --> 00:01:04.725
"They are getting ready for a special ceremony," said Gildong.

15
00:01:05.845 --> 00:01:09.866
Vinnie watched a woman pounding something with a thick stick.

16
00:01:11.387 --> 00:01:14.308
"She's pounding rice," explained Gildong.

17
00:01:15.288 --> 00:01:18.409
The children saw a room with a big table.

18
00:01:19.549 --> 00:01:21.630
A girl was placing food there.

19
00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:25.131
"I'm hungry," Mandy said.

20
00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:31.288
"Sorry, but the food is for the ceremony," said Gildong.

21
00:01:31.308 --> 00:01:34.029
"Tonight they are remembering the nobleman's grandfather.

22
00:01:35.069 --> 00:01:37.250
He died on this day many years ago."

23
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:41.351
"I don't understand," said Mandy.

24
00:01:41.371 --> 00:01:45.472
"Why are they making food for someone who died?"

25
00:01:45.492 --> 00:01:51.654
"The family honors their grandfather by offering wine and food," said Gildong.

26
00:01:53.114 --> 00:01:53.995
Mandy nodded.

27
00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:58.836
Vinnie asked where the food would go after the ceremony.

28
00:01:59.872 --> 00:02:04.015
"The nobleman's family will share it with others," Gildong said.

29
00:02:04.035 --> 00:02:07.217
"That's an important part of the ceremony."

30
00:02:07.237 --> 00:02:10.719
"Gildong!" a voice shouted.

31
00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:15.463
The children turned to see an old woman waving at them.

32
00:02:15.483 --> 00:02:18.925
"Finally!" she said to Gildong.

33
00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:21.567
"You have come with the bowls!

34
00:02:22.647 --> 00:02:25.849
We are thankful your father could make these for us."

35
00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:31.525
Gildong unwrapped the basket and gave the bowls to the woman.

36
00:02:31.545 --> 00:02:34.026
"May I look at one?"

37
00:02:34.426 --> 00:02:35.146
asked Mandy.

38
00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:38.768
"Yes." The woman handed one to her.

39
00:02:38.788 --> 00:02:42.549
"It's so smooth," Mandy said.

40
00:02:42.569 --> 00:02:48.552
"One day I will make bowls like that too," said Gildong proudly.

41
00:02:49.652 --> 00:02:53.034
The woman thanked the children for bringing the bowls.

42
00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:57.696
"You must have a snack before you leave," she said.

43
00:02:58.804 --> 00:03:00.626
"Have a seat and wait here.

44
00:03:01.727 --> 00:03:03.548
I will be back in a few minutes."

45
00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.951
The woman soon returned.

46
00:03:07.952 --> 00:03:10.834
She was carrying a tray of snacks for the children.

47
00:03:10.854 --> 00:03:14.798
"Mmm These are so sweet!

48
00:03:15.418 --> 00:03:16.359
What are they?"

49
00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.722
Mandy asked, chewing on an orange fruit.

50
00:03:19.742 --> 00:03:23.745
"They are dried persimmons," Gildong answered.

51
00:03:23.765 --> 00:03:26.668
"And these are rice cakes."

52
00:03:27.732 --> 00:03:31.254
He popped a soft white rice cake into his mouth.

53
00:03:32.354 --> 00:03:36.536
When they were finished, Gildong stood and bowed to the woman.

54
00:03:36.556 --> 00:03:39.157
"Thank you," he said.

55
00:03:40.557 --> 00:03:43.198
Vinnie and Mandy hopped up too and bowed.

56
00:03:43.218 --> 00:03:44.999
"Thank you!"

57
00:03:45.499 --> 00:03:46.100
they said.

58
00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:50.722
"Good-bye!" The children left the house.

59
00:03:51.922 --> 00:03:53.763
Suddenly Gildong stopped.

60
00:03:54.803 --> 00:03:56.364
"Hmm," he said.

61
00:03:57.388 --> 00:03:58.790
"Do you hear something?"

62
00:03:59.892 --> 00:04:01.375
Mandy's face lit up.

63
00:04:02.436 --> 00:04:03.959
"Yes!" she said.

64
00:04:03.979 --> 00:04:06.403
"I hear music!"
